\"She visited the rosegarden every morning from 8 am till 9 am\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text directly states this visiting pattern and timing.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-003\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"From 02:00 till 15:30 o'clock, she worked in the rosegarden to tidy it up\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text explicitly states this work period and purpose.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-004\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Her mother did not appreciate that she, as a princess, would actually work in the garden\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text directly states the mother's lack of appreciation.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-005\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"the princess didn't care\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text states in context that the princess did not care about her mother's disapproval.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-006\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"The rosegarden lost all his life in winter\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The pronoun 'his' is a grammatical error for 'its', but the meaning is identical.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-007\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"the young lady could not enjoy the beautiful colors and all the life the rosegarden harbored\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text states she could not enjoy these aspects in winter.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-008\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"once spring arrived, it turned back to life and color\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text explicitly states the garden recovered when spring came.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-009\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"the rose garden was the private property of the royal family\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text directly states this property status.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-010\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"the young princess insisted on making the garden accessible to the public every March 1st to March 31st\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text explicitly states this insistence and specific dates.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-011\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"people from all over the country traveled to the castel to enjoy a nice day wandering through the rosegarden\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text states people from all over traveled to wander through the garden.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-012\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"It became tradition that everyone who visited the rosegarden from the outside picked their favorite scenery and tried to draw what they liked most\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text establishes this as a tradition of drawing favorite scenery.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-013\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"They then sent the postcard to their home\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text states visitors sent postcards to their homes; plural claim reflects collective action.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-014\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"People were starting to make bets on whether the postcard arrived at their home before they arrived home\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text explicitly describes this betting practice.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-015\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"In many cases, it was a tie because the people and the postcards were usually transported in the same carriage\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"A tie means simultaneous arrival; same carriage explains why this happened often.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-016\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"the people and the postcards were usually transported in the same carriage\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text directly states this transportation method.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-001\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"an old lady that lived in a dark, spooky forest\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The opening establishes that an old lady lived in a forest.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-002\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"The forest was not traversable between October and April\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text explicitly states this traversability period.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-003\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"The old lady nevertheless lived the entire year in the forest\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text directly states she lived year-round in the forest.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-004\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"she acclimated to the weather\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text states she acclimated to weather conditions over time.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-005\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"built strategies to survive the harsh conditions\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text explicitly states she built survival strategies.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-006\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"many people suspected the old lady would be a witch that worked on forbidden magic\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text directly states these public suspicions about the lady.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-007\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"she collected wild herbs\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text states she collected wild herbs.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-008\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Those wild herbs were tried and sold to wandering travelers\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text explicitly states the herbs were sold to traveling merchants.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-009\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"wandering travelers who transported and sold the herbs into the cities\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text states travelers transported and sold herbs to cities.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-010\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"In one harsh winter, many people of the nearby village became very sick\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text directly states this illness outbreak occurred in winter.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-011\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"one young man took the courage and traveled to the old lady's house deep in the woods\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text states a young man traveled to her house in the woods.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-012\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"It took him days to reach her house\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text explicitly states the journey required multiple days.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-013\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"he struggled with the wet and slippery ground\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text directly states this difficulty encountered during travel.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-014\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"He also lost his orientation several times\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text explicitly states he became disoriented multiple times.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-015\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"he reached her house\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text directly states he eventually reached the old lady's house.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-016\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"He carefully knocked\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text states he knocked on the door.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-017\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"hoped that all the rumors about the lady were untrue\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text states his hope the rumors were false; 'lady' refers to the old lady.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-018\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"she opened the door\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text states she opened the door.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-019\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"saw the young man\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text states she saw the young man upon opening the door.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-020\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"she asked him to come into his house, sit at the fire and drink some hot soup she made for him\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Despite 'his' being a grammatical error for 'her', context clearly refers to the old lady's house.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-021\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"the man recovered\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text states the man recovered before receiving medicine.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-022\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"she gave him enough medicine made out of the herbs she collected in spring for the entire village\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text states the old lady gave medicine from her spring-collected herbs to help the village.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-023\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"He traveled back to his village\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text directly states he returned to his village.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-024\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"went to the home of every sick person\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text explicitly states he visited every sick person's home.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-025\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"provide them with the correct amount of medicine as told by the old lady from the woods\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text states he provided correct amounts as the old lady instructed.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-026\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"everyone got healthy\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text directly states everyone recovered from illness.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-027\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"the villagers sent a huge basket of cheese and dried meat to the old lady every autumn\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text explicitly states villagers sent this gift annually in autumn.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```","ttft_ms":94621,"type":"result","duration_ms":113683,"uuid":"f3c196e7-ea13-496c-98fa-f3f4ec16a7de","ttft_stream_ms":756,"time_to_request_ms":116,"first_content_frame_ms":757,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
